=== exp1: CE traffic vs independent sm90 GEMM ===
world 4, GEMM on GPU 0, fp16 CUTLASS (TmaWarpSpecializedCooperative 128x256x64)
GPU 0: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 1: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 2: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
GPU 3: NVIDIA H800  sm_90  132 SMs  1980 MHz
[note] lock clocks (nvidia-smi -lgc) before trusting slowdowns.

--- GEMM 2048x2048x2048 fp16: alone 30.0 us/iter (p95 30.2), 573.5 TFLOP/s, 2048 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |        32.1      33.4  1.070    536.0 |     176.38     164.33 | 
push        64M    |        31.0      32.1  1.034    554.5 |     176.46     162.62 | 
allgather   64M    |        39.8      46.8  1.329    431.6 |     348.75     372.34 | 
bystander   64M    |        30.0      30.2  1.001    573.0 |     316.91     497.49 | 
engine-only 64M    |        29.9      30.4  0.998    575.0 |     171.04     153.29 | 
local       64M    |        66.7      69.2  2.228    257.4 |    1398.57     976.51 | 
baseline recheck: alone 30.0 -> 30.1 us/iter (drift +0.5%)

