--- GEMM 8192x8192x8192 fp16: alone 1704.8 us/iter (p95 1774.0), 645.0 TFLOP/s, 111 iters ---
pattern     msg    | ovl us/iter   ovl p95    S_c  TFLOP/s | alone GB/s   ovl GB/s | note
pull        64M    |      1730.0    1836.4  1.015    635.6 |     176.39     173.63 | 
